From f31ca5fb333e2b29506e6f128e3ce5937ef69dc5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 21:58:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix WHM wireless power-save recovery after radio disable

Add confirmed VAP teardown notifications, persist disabled-radio state,
and gate backhaul recovery on complete teardown. Also update WHM build
definitions and related action/message handling.

Signed-off-by: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
